<https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/berlin-wisdom-paradigm#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/berlin-wisdom-paradigm/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/berlin-wisdom-paradigm/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Have I considered how this problem looks across the person's whole life, past and future, and not only today?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/berlin-wisdom-paradigm/check/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/berlin-wisdom-paradigm> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/berlin-wisdom-paradigm/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/berlin-wisdom-paradigm/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Have I named what I do not know about this situation, and what I would do if things turn out differently than I expect?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/berlin-wisdom-paradigm/check/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/berlin-wisdom-paradigm> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/berlin-wisdom-paradigm/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/berlin-wisdom-paradigm/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Am I judging this choice by my own values only, or have I tried to understand the values and priorities behind it?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/berlin-wisdom-paradigm/check/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/berlin-wisdom-paradigm> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/berlin-wisdom-paradigm> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-11-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
