  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/berlin-wisdom-paradigm> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A research model, developed by Paul Baltes and colleagues in Berlin, that treats wisdom as expert knowledge and judgment about the conduct and meaning of life, measured by rating people's think-aloud answers to hard life dilemmas against five criteria." .
